{"pull": {"id": "number:21081", "number": 21081, "title": "KAFKA-19965: Increasing batch size to fix throttled delivery test", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:01:03Z", "closed_at": "2025-12-05T09:56:06Z", "merged_at": "2025-12-05T09:56:06Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The PR increases the max.poll.records config to 512 as the produced\nbatch is of 512 records. SharePartition creates batches as per `share\nfetch` request batch-size config, which is currently controlled by\nmax.poll.records. Drfault max.poll.records config is 500 and If producer\ngenerates multiple batches on log then there will be multiple batches in\nshare partition. The throttled response in fetch is based on batch size\nin share partition hence subsequent throttles fetch calls can have\ndifferent sizes as per the produces batches. To make sure the batch is\nof correct size in share partition increase the max.poll.records to 512.\n\nThe same has been done in other test but missed in the current PR test:\nhttps://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/a8b1fb9203133a356732bf069aa3e0dd9b1716b7/clients/clients-integration-tests/src/test/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/ShareConsumerTest.java#L3707\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>, Lan Ding\n <isDing_L@163.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 1257747426, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwxMjU3NzQ3NDI2", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/tests", "name": "tests", "color": "cfff60", "default": false, "description": "Test fixes (including flaky tests)", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7491388177, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvoWDEQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/clients", "name": "clients", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21081"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_apoorvmittal10_is_pr.json"}